      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of an anomalous insertion of the pectoralis minor on to the capsule of the gleno-humeral joint is described. It produced signs of deficiency of the rotator cuff. The anomaly had previously been described in anatomy textbooks but does not seem to have been observed previously by clinicians."},
